## Electrical Specifications & Compliance Criteria
- **Continuity**: Contact resistance strictly ≤ R_nom × (1 + tol%). Zero opens.
- **Differential Impedance**: PCIe 85 Ω ± 10%. Reflection ≤ -20 dB.
- **Capacitance**: Liquid sensing pads 12.5 - 15.5 pF ± 15%, Proximity 8.0 pF ± 15%.
- **Probe Clearance**: Minimum vertical flight height ≥ 15.0 mm above all board component obstacles.
